                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2fa1510-4b32-4e87-a53b-13d91485a445",
                                "sense_id": "0ab3fa20-2af9-365e-a1b6-afa48bc5c98a",
                                "text": "After the first showerful of earth was flung in over the victims, the infant Patsy stirred his feeble hand slightly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "557bd524-bf04-4e8f-a62b-c6de1c4dff30",
                                "sense_id": "0ab3fa20-2af9-365e-a1b6-afa48bc5c98a",
                                "text": "white snow falls from the sky o o w o o in small drops in big drops in whole showersful"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e44d1e75-e000-49ea-bf23-924a69f1381a",
                                "sense_id": "0ab3fa20-2af9-365e-a1b6-afa48bc5c98a",
                                "text": "Our show tonight is powerful, We'll wow you with an hourful Of showers from a showerful of stars"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af10f090-bd91-4721-a900-7f07d603f0a7",
                                "sense_id": "0ab3fa20-2af9-365e-a1b6-afa48bc5c98a",
                                "text": "Enlil hates me and I can no longer dwell among you, can no longer set my footsteps on the soil that is Enlils; but if I go down into the Apsu, dwelling with my lord Ea, then will Enlil send you showerfuls, raining down abundance on you."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b53ca1cb-e578-43cf-8b37-c1a2e86d024f",
                                "sense_id": "0ab3fa20-2af9-365e-a1b6-afa48bc5c98a",
                                "text": "While Jim McAllister may continue lying to himself about his usefulness through another couple of broken marriages and career failures, you come out of Election suspecting that Tracy's delusions will, at some point not too far away, hit her with an awful powerful showerful of truth, and she will stagger under its weight."
                            }
                        ]
